X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherNorth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenant_id": "{{tenantNorth}}", "reference": "WO-7004", "title": "Water on the floor", "status": "new", "priority": 2, "is_emergency": true, "access_code": "7004", "customer_id": "{{CreateNorthCustomer.response.body.$.id}}", "region_id": "{{CreateNorthRegion.response.body.$.id}}" }

### WO-7005: SOUTH, scheduled for a morning long gone — south's overdue job, which north's report must never name
# @name CreateWo7005
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [201]
POST {{fshBaseUrl}}/api/work_orders
X-Alvo-Api-Key: {{keyDispatcherSouth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenant_id": "{{tenantSouth}}", "reference": "WO-7005", "title": "Oven door hinge", "status": "scheduled", "priority": 3, "access_code": "7005", "scheduled_for": "2026-01-05T09:00:00Z", "assigned_to": "{{userDispatcherSouth}}", "customer_id": "{{CreateSouthCustomer.response.body.$.id}}", "region_id": "{{CreateNorthRegion.response.body.$.id}}" }

